pageName = "Rarities"
pageDescription = "Rarities determine how often a card appears in the shop. Green cards are Common, blue cards are Rare, red cards are Mythic, and yellow cards are Legendary.

Mythic cards start to appear in the shop from  Act 2 and Legendary cards start to appear in the shop from Act 3."
